{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Customs officer","text":"Aha, trying to smuggle rum are we?","uri":"20204e42a3d1c106c34fe728d7d90f9b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Customs officer","text":"Because Asgarnia has banned the import of intoxicating spirits.","uri":"a8e78457e716697328ebea1cbbceb45a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Customs officer","text":"Can I help you?","uri":"993ae16d95f5857c7c6dc0a78926ad41.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Customs officer","text":"I'm not that sort of customs officer.","uri":"e22f989dca478d521f989851eede19b1.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Customs officer","text":"Oh, I think I do. If you don't want to let me search your possessions, then you're not coming aboard this ship.","uri":"31635b5fdcde7d3184749a5e2f407a05.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Customs officer","text":"This is not the Karamja rum we are looking for.","uri":"8cda30923d617b1802619e19f5e2c936.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Customs officer","text":"Well you've got some odd stuff, but it's all legal. Now you need to pay a boarding charge of 30 coins.","uri":"14e6207d326f37d0a65fd958637dd2b7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Customs officer","text":"You need to be searched before you can board.","uri":"0b69bcde7b8f0dd963084b81ccf62875.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Customs officer","text":"You're not getting on this ship then.","uri":"94bac21f09beb05c56faffb0aaccfe88.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Gardener","text":"First moles, now this! Take this, vandal!","uri":"f32b88abd7099afb8cc2e29b22c7e0ea.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Imp","text":"Don't you know? You can get into trouble for giving alcohol to minors, and I'm pretty small, it has to be said.","uri":"f2ee49194bc4d9f3aab0b55210ba60cd.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Luthas","text":"Hello I'm Luthas, I run the banana plantation here.","uri":"66d3597a6997510d82b6d31fc8c45904.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Luthas","text":"I sell them to Wydin who runs a grocery store in Port Sarim.","uri":"080f5d028c3e595bbc1fc1e90ae74ac0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Luthas","text":"If you could fill it up with bananas, I'll pay you 30 gold.","uri":"080557845f077213edcbf5e9e3a6da01.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Luthas","text":"If you go outside you should see the old crate has been loaded on to the ship, and there is another empty crate in its place.","uri":"0daac7b4b45dd8e0c31caf8161d9a616.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Luthas","text":"She doesn't even search my export crates any more. She knows they only contain bananas.","uri":"3485cdd77c3815eb463e3001d7b04087.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Luthas","text":"There is a little shop over in Port Sarim that buys them up by the crate. I believe it is run by a man called Wydin.","uri":"408f85ce0da7eb490a3a0ce6d9804d36.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Luthas","text":"Well done, here's your payment.","uri":"407b8f94a384706e1d8ccea474a54f22.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Luthas","text":"Well I know her pretty well. She doesn't cause me any trouble any more.","uri":"d1ee115466027a7ed52a7b83fe8c4a8f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Luthas","text":"Yes certainly.","uri":"f297b10debb6b3391d578717dfdcfc0a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Luthas","text":"Yes, I can sort something out. There's a crate ready to be loaded onto the ship.","uri":"ce37fbdc58e5cbf7383e410a36a444c6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Luthas","text":"You wouldn't believe the demand for bananas from Wydin's shop over in Port Sarim. I think this is the third crate I've shipped him this month..","uri":"d9c8548bb7ef443f237fb92791455ebf.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Player Female","text":"Can I buy something please?","uri":"279b4ca66289200dd87979b436cd3df4.mp3"}
