{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Arr - I don't likes banana in me rum!","uri":"b8919a03cc0944b1fdb0d827c7cb4f3f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Arr - this here rum's got a banana stuck in it!","uri":"da69a82417ec46304a7016d74d79cb5a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Arr, Matey!","uri":"9acf4db26cd8f765e8ff67e171b6c5f4.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Arr, silly you. Fortunately I took the precaution to have another one made.","uri":"78712a4804c2db9d7f3eff99f0a65dd1.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Arr, that's the spirit!","uri":"b56aaeb84d6279b540805246516450b0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Arr, treasure you be after eh? Well I might be able to tell you where to find some... For a price...","uri":"ae3bb51f6718187eec5f3b8fd1f0ef4e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Fair enough. I'll still be here and thirsty whenever you feel like helpin' out.","uri":"ad6aee2abdb068897fcb94abe595389c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Gadzooks, that swill! Not a chance!","uri":"1d379605ea2195ffcf4ef2e69374633d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Have ye brought some rum for yer ol' mate Frank?","uri":"c3fe2c7963640d9400cc60fff2b1bd32.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Hector were killed along with many of the crew, I were one of the few to escape and I escaped with this.","uri":"b5b3f8fb3238068854ae5fcd49e665c9.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Hector were very successful and became very rich. But about a year ago we were boarded by the Customs and Excise Agents.","uri":"ed8f3f58753b6282777fff91310e1c42.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"I'd like some rum made on Karamja Island. There's no rum like Karamja Rum!","uri":"a454071616e8be890d9ad30013aaaff5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"I'm not allowed in the Blue Moon Inn. Apparently I'm a drunken trouble maker.","uri":"4ddb27ec42f858ab7877544377f2fdc2.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"It's Karamja Rum or no deal.","uri":"1c847e8391c04d496414a919dcec7dd9.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"No lad, you got it fair and square.","uri":"14f2f7c7b42dcb64bed936c4fb818758.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Not surprising, tis no easy task to get it off Karamja.","uri":"3e7c552470a40456244eced6e01cd2a5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Now a deal's a deal, I'll tell ye about the treasure. I used to serve under a pirate captain called One-Eyed Hector.","uri":"bed9c640694b7f4e59fa61e6e091208a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"The Customs office has been clampin' down on the export of spirits. You seem like a resourceful young lad, I'm sure ye'll be able to find a way to slip the stuff past them.","uri":"d295d7dea16d62b32309eaf6b0453af0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"This be Hector's key. I believe it opens his chest in his old room in the Blue Moon Inn in Varrock.","uri":"d960be284139f793a6685f719d3f840d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Well for example if you can get me a bottle of rum... Not just any rum mind...","uri":"69ab0a89f36f6116ad76860d8c929558.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"With any luck his treasure will be in there.","uri":"4216042d8ac135de3b3149c8276a8be0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"Yer a saint, although it'll take a miracle to get it off Karamja.","uri":"1fe6081dd066b6e130c5895cd6ffee58.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Redbeard Frank","text":"You enjoy it. It's what Hector would have wanted.","uri":"248aca0b79e64ac41079869ca21e93d8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Ah well, it'll give you something to do, won't it.","uri":"5045f7aaf7b23e95d8254847d3246dc7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Can you put your white apron on before going in there, please?","uri":"c0090fa3fad7fc38ce50de34338e0bec.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Hey, you can't go in there. Only employees of the grocery store can go in.","uri":"047630487e4d39a9da61f2b8e2ed3a96.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Is it nice and tidy round the back now?","uri":"a5480d48456f6cadabe2b832a6c728a5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"No, I'm the one who works here.","uri":"012b77b34833d189129d2d25dd572b1d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Oh, and I'm sure that I've seen a spare one over in Gerrant's fish store somewhere. It's the little place just north of here.","uri":"2fc55f1983b164fb0d4cc8a935e6028a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Umm... No, not yet.","uri":"1aaf4d989cb1426cd958c4df95e4f5f6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Welcome to my food store! Would you like to buy anything?","uri":"1a15f6a6f48f0e18988ebe6b3f87254e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Well, I get all of mine over at the clothing shop in Varrock. They sell them cheap there.","uri":"c241dc56744ceff51ecfe75f971463f6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Well, you can't work here unless you have a white apron. Health and safety regulations, you understand.","uri":"2656625f58435aceb352cdbed28a741b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Well, you're keen, I'll give you that. Okay, I'll give you a go. Have you got your own white apron?","uri":"bafb31e1e5fc8965c6597799d34d23b9.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Wow - you are well prepared! You're hired. Go through to the back and tidy up for me, please.","uri":"3b5fe0ab9fb273181520400f841c1f3c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"Yes, of course.","uri":"4d3e704bbefd332a549c2541a914c632.mp3"}
{"quest":"Pirate's Treasure","character":"Wydin","text":"You need to put your white apron on first though.","uri":"54dd9eebb0c2cad8b6f3f5c75bfbc9bd.mp3"}
